  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nIn\r\n\r\n> Otherwise, set _completion_ to [Completion Record](https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-completion-record-specification-type) { [[Type]]: normal, [[Value]]: _result_'s [record](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-script-record), [[Target]]: empty }.\r\n\r\n_result_ is not defined. Probably it should be _moduleScript_ instead.",
